Let's Go

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
This world is bursting with colors

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,079
Truth and lies bewilder our eyes

5
00:00:30,079 --> 00:00:33,079
Use your heart and truly see

6
00:00:33,079 --> 00:00:36,079
Find the truth is right here

7
00:00:36,079 --> 00:00:39,100
Hey you good or bad, true and false

8
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:42,100
You can't escape this heart's gray smoke

9
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:45,079
Bring all the courage that you have

10
00:00:45,079 --> 00:00:48,240
Maybe then you can save this world

11
